<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Divine Resistance</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 4)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast divine resistance &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast divine resistance</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Raises the target's divine sphere for about ten minutes. Your ability in a 
sphere also protects you against its spells (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>), so the 
target resists divine spells cast at them better: harm, cause wounds and the 
like. The better your protection sphere, the bigger the raise, up to ten 
points and a little more for a master.
</p><p>It doesn't add up: cast on someone who already has it, the magic just 
dissipates. You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on potions, 
wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Raise Divine</a>
</pre>




</div>